{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/3ae0e60866d84c6ff644e2616ce9f689.avif?t=1757882076\" data-has-big width=1560 height=519 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom boards with new layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're not limited to the standard pieces, let your creativity out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with an aggressive forward assault, Or perhaps a defensive fortress designed to weather the storm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's like chess but with deckbuilding and dragons...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you outwit, outmanoeuvre, or out-explode your way to victory?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841900/extras/a0a1c0f746167b1b5d27365ae87c77b8.avif?t=1757882076\" data-has-big width=1560 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fusefort</strong>: Explodes on capturing/capture, destroying all pieces on that square and to the sides</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spearman</strong>: pawn who can sidestep and lunge forward to attack 2 spaces ahead</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cracked</strong> Pawn: a cheaper &amp; weaker pawn, allowing you to purchase more powerful pieces elsewhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warden</strong>: A castle that somehow learned to jump, though now he can only reach 2 spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>C4D4</strong>: Self-destructs destroying a part 